&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in finance, business, economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–6+ years of sales experience in financial services, with a combination of inside and/or field sales exposure is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
