&lt;li&gt;FINRA Series 7 and Series 63 licenses are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills; polished, professional presence in both phone and in-person settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce CRM and outbound sequencing tools (Outreach or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and able to travel within assigned territory (estimated 25–40% travel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed with strong organizational skills and the ability to manage competing inside and field priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of alternative investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into or supporting RIAs and independent broker-dealers networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of converting phone-initiated relationships into productive in-person sales meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
