&lt;p&gt;iCapital is looking to hire an Internal Wholesale Associate to join the Alternative Distribution team. The ideal candidate will work with new and existing advisors throughout the lifecycle of the alternative investment. You&#39;ll partner with External Wholesalers and own advisor relationships actively prospecting, educating, and closing new business while deepening engagement with existing clients. You&#39;ll be the connective tissue between financial advisors and iCapital&#39;s full ecosystem, driving platform adoption and revenue growth across our alternatives marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
