&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is seeking a driven, high-energy Outbound Sales Associate to join the Alternative Investment Distribution team. This individual will be the first point of contact for financial advisors who are not yet active on the iCapital alternative investment platform. &amp;nbsp;This is a high-volume, metric-driven inside sales role designed for professionals who thrive in a structured calling environment and are passionate about alternative investments and the wealth management industry.&lt;/p&gt;
