&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 3+ years of hands-on experience in business process analysis or RPA development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Proficiency in UiPath Studio, UiPath Orchestrator, and UiPath Assistant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience developing automation using REFramework and exception-handling best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
