&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital Network is seeking an Associate for the International Client Solutions Asia Pacific team to contribute to the development and execution of iCapital’s international expansion strategy in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will support the relationship management and business development activities of iCapital with a primary focus on Banks/Wealth Managers. iCapital’s rapid international expansion creates an opportunity for a seasoned professional to join a fast-paced, rapid-growth environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the management and growth of relationships with Private Banks, Wealth Managers, and Multi-Family Offices across the Southeast Asia region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in delivering a consultative client experience by identifying opportunities to deepen engagement across iCapital&#39;s platform and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and support internal projects, helping to develop processes, tracking tools, and operating frameworks for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare client presentations, reports, and analyses to support business development and relationship management activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of private markets and alternative investments and effectively communicate iCapital&#39;s solutions and capabilities to clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams, including product, operations, legal, compliance, and fund management teams, to support fund launches and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
