&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day client requests and follow-ups, ensuring timely execution and a high standard of client service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support relationship managers in identifying opportunities for client expansion, increased platform adoption, and deeper client engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
