&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid academic credentials in relevant field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;3+ years of solid work experience in the Asset- or Wealth Management industry, with a demonstrated track record in developing and managing client relationships is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adequate exposure to Private Equity and/or other Private Markets asset classes, and an understanding of the distribution model is highly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial approach to managing projects with excellent problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation and verbal/written communication skills with demonstrated capabilities to build trust, and strategically manage and influence stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with AI tools and modern CRM platforms such as Salesforce, and comfortable using them to improve productivity, client coverage and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative, and able to think strategically about business opportunities and client management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with a strong appetite to work in a fast growing, entrepreneurial environment, are self-motivated, with a hands-on attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; ability to speak other Asian languages are a strong asset&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best ideas and innovation happen when we are together. Employees in this role will work in the office four days, with the flexibility to work remotely one day (Friday). &lt;/p&gt;
