&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxelementtoproof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxelementtoproof&quot;&gt;iCapital is looking to hire an Analyst Configuration Developer who is responsible for implementing and maintaining business rules within FireLight®, Hexure’s (now part of iCapital) proprietary SaaS electronic fulfillment platform. This role builds on foundational configuration skills to handle moderately complex business logic, ensuring that financial product applications are completed “In-Good-Order” with accuracy, completeness, and compliance. This individual will collaborate closely with internal teams and clients to deliver high-quality solutions, improve user experience, and meet project timelines and KPIs.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxelementtoproof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Configure and maintain business rules within FireLight® to drive accurate and compliant user experiences for financial product applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Implement configuration components including Role Codes, Review Queues, Needs Determination, mapping documents, and admin mappings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Ensure applications meet standards across completeness, compliance, and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Participate across the SDLC including requirements understanding, configuration, testing, and deployment support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Perform unit and integration testing to validate accuracy and quality of configured business rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Support customer deployments, ensuring timely and accurate implementation of configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Monitor and resolve issues via ticketing systems (Jira), ensuring timely turnaround and minimal client disruption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Provide Tier 2 production support by troubleshooting configuration-related issues and triaging client tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to resolve defects, improve configurations, and enhance platform performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Use AI tools to accelerate rule creation, scenario testing, and issue investigation to improve efficiency and reduce rework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to coding best practices including simplicity, modularity, and reusability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Meet utilization, productivity, and quality benchmarks, including low churn and on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Participate in team meetings, providing clear updates on progress, risks, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xxelementtoproof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;1–3 years of experience in a technical or configuration-focused role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in XML (creation, editing, troubleshooting) and understanding of structured business logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) in a SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Familiar with FireLight® platform components and configuration concepts (or ability to ramp quickly)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of tools such as Jira (ticketing), OpenAir (time tracking), Notepad++ (rule development), and Adobe Acrobat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Exposure to integrations with third-party platforms (i.e. Salesforce, Redtail, Yellow Pages) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Foundational understanding of financial services domain (insurance, annuities, life insurance processes, compliance requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with attention to detail and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Able to manage multiple tasks and priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Effective written and verbal communication skills with the ability to collaborate across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Self-driven with a learning mindset and willingness to adopt new technologies, including AI-enabled tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xxmsonormal&quot;&gt;Able to work independently with minimal supervision while contributing effectively as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
