&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;iCapital is seeking a highly motivated and intellectually curious Equity Accounting and Reporting Associate to join the Corporate Finance team. This role offers a unique opportunity to become a subject matter expert in stock-based compensation accounting, equity reporting, and related tax and financial reporting matters within a rapidly growing global fintech organization. This individual will gain exposure to complex technical accounting issues, strategic transactions, and cross-functional initiatives that directly impact the Company&#39;s capital structure and growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Support the monthly accounting, reporting, and quarterly/annual close activities related to the Company&#39;s global stock-based compensation programs under ASC 718.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Prepare and maintain stock compensation calculations, expense forecasts, valuation support schedules, account reconciliations, and disclosure support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Analyze the accounting implications of equity transactions, including grants, exercises, vesting events, modifications, forfeitures, cancellations, RSU settlements, share issuances, and other strategic transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Evaluate complex equity-related transactions, including acquisitions, replacement awards, recapitalizations, liquidity events, and new equity program structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Prepare stock-based compensation disclosures and supporting analyses for financial statements, management reporting, and regulatory filings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist with equity-related tax accounting analyses, including deferred tax assets, tax deductions, excess tax benefits, and stock compensation impacts on the income tax provision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Support technical accounting research, documentation, and stakeholder collaboration related to stock compensation, equity transactions, and emerging accounting guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Serve as a key finance contact for external auditors, preparing audit-ready documentation and responding to audit inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Support the design, execution, documentation, and enhancement of SOX controls and governance processes related to stock compensation and equity reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist in preparing analyses and documentation supporting global tax, regulatory, and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Partner with Human Resources, Legal, Payroll, Tax, and third-party equity administrators to ensure accurate processing and reporting of equity transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Monitor and reconcile equity activity across source systems, capitalization records, and the general ledger.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist with capitalization table management, share reserve analyses, and related equity reporting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Identify and execute opportunities to automate processes, enhance reporting capabilities, strengthen internal controls, and support process transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Prepare analyses and presentations supporting management decision-making and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Contribute to special projects related to equity programs, acquisitions, and organizational growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in accounting, finance, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;CPA certification is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in public accounting, technical accounting, audit, financial reporting, or corporate accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong foundation in U.S. GAAP and financial reporting concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Exposure to ASC 718, ASC 740, business combinations, valuation, or technical accounting matters is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to analyze complex transactions and communicate accounting conclusions clearly and effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Advanced Microsoft Excel skills, including financial modeling, large-data analysis, reconciliations, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills with the ability to effectively manage multiple priorities and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in a controlled environment with a focus on governance, process discipline, and audit readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Highly collaborative with the ability to work cross-functionally across Finance, Tax, Legal, HR, Payroll, and external advisors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $ 110,000 to $ 140,000. iCapital offers a compensation package which includes salary, equity for all full-time employees, and an annual performance bonus. Employees also receive a comprehensive benefits package that includes an employer matched retirement plan, generously subsidized healthcare with 100% employer paid dental, vision, telemedicine, and virtual mental health counseling, parental leave, and unlimited paid time off (PTO).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best ideas and innovation happen when we are together. Employees in this role will work in the office Monday-Thursday, with the flexibility to work remotely on Friday.&lt;/p&gt;
