&lt;li&gt;3-7 years of corporate governance, corporate law, entity management, or related legal experience, preferably within a law firm or in-house legal department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting multinational corporate structures and subsidiary governance programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of corporate governance principles and entity lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent drafting, analytical, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced and evolving business environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented with strong judgment and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office applications, including Word and Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
