&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is looking to a hire a Vice President to join the Platform Infrastructure team. This team plays a critical role in keeping the production and development environments running smoothly and securely.&amp;nbsp; This role will utilize advanced cloud capabilities to facilitate Platform Infrastructure strategy of market agility and lean operating principles with a strict focus on quality to meet the ever-growing demands of clients. The ideal candidate is highly collaborative, creative, intellectually curious and passionate about forming and implementing cutting-edge cloud computing capabilities. As a Platform Engineer, this individual will be wearing multiple hats in a highly visible role interacting with all aspects of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build highly available solutions across the entire SDLC stack with a primary focus on an internet facing fintech site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the relationship between the Platform Infrastructure team and the Information Security Team in remediating security issues related to platforms, CI/CD pipelines, or development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to security best practices for shifting security left and establishing a strong security culture within the DevOps and Platform Infrastructure team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain tools to support the development environment on MacOS and Linux tool environment with focus on improving developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain site reliability with a focus on building highly scalable systems integrating resiliency and high availability at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop software and tooling to secure and automate cloud infrastructure building software delivery capabilities with fully automatic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and operate a Kubernetes environment for container management and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of DevOps or SRE experience with 4+ years of AWS experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of CI/CD pipeline development in GitLab, GitHub, or similar frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with security best practices in AWS, including remediating SecurityHub findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with DevSecOps tools, including SAST tools, DAST tools, and SCA tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microservices (Docker, Kubernetes) experience in a production environment is strongly&amp;nbsp;desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux OS-level and command-line and scripting knowledge and configuration management principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of databases such as MongoDB, Postgres, and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding beyond simple scripting with strong opinions on maintainable and reusable code in Python, Ruby or Java is desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with computer provisioning on a Cloud based platform using Terraform or Cloud formation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical skills and able to apply knowledge and experience in decision-making to arrive at creative and commercial solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a Microservice based architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to design and implement complex, but easily managed, automated infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to share, teach and learn as part of a team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level knowledge of networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems design, maintenance, and hands-on troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with debugging issues with the FIX protocol to include maintaining and establishing fix sessions and or session management + order routing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in system tuning and performance testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS certifications are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
