&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is seeking an Event Content Strategist Vice President to join the Global Events team. This role will be responsible for shaping and driving the content strategy across iCapital&#39;s US portfolio of proprietary and sponsored conferences. Reporting to the Global Head of Events, this individual will sit at the intersection of event strategy, agenda development, speaker management, and audience engagement. This role ensures every event tells a compelling and cohesive story that aligns with iCapital&#39;s business priorities, market positioning, and evolving industry trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
