&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to executives, clients, sponsors, and external speakers on content strategy, messaging, and event participation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Sponsorship team to maximize sponsor participation through speaking opportunities, panel discussions, thought leadership sessions, and content activations that align with sponsor expertise and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable content and speaker management processes, including playbooks, timelines, and frameworks that improve efficiency, consistency, and execution across events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track agenda performance, speaker effectiveness, and audience engagement metrics, delivering post-event insights and recommendations to drive continuous improvement and inform future event strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12+ years of experience in event content strategy, conference programming, communications, marketing, or related fields&lt;/li&gt;
