&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is looking to hire a Fund Monitoring Analyst to join the Fund Monitoring,&amp;nbsp;Reporting and Governance team. This individual will be responsible for conducting ongoing investment monitoring for private market fund investments across the iCapital platform. Over time, this role will also involve presenting investment updates to both internal stakeholders as well as wealth advisors and their clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
