&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;iCapital is seeking a motivated Payroll professional to join the growing Corporate Finance team. This role will assist the Global Payroll Team in managing the company’s current in-house and outsourced payrolls, provide payroll insight and services to employees and partners, and help execute related processes and payroll data management. This individual will gain experience for a global payroll career that rewards versatility, and strong detail-orientation. This role also offers the opportunity to collaborate on important projects within Corporate Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist with Global Payroll (US, Canada, UK, Hong Kong, Singapore, Portugal, Switzerland, and Japan).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reconcile all changes that affect pay which include salary adjustments, location changes, leaves, and returns, bonuses and commissions, deductions, and one-time payments such as referral awards, relocation stipends, and severance payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Review and finalize timesheets for a small population of US non-exempt employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Manage other pay inputs such as garnishments and deduction corrections as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Manage the day-to-day relationship with payroll service partners, including correspondence, ad-hoc requests, escalation, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist the Global Payroll team with reconciling and approving payrolls timely and accurately, in partnership with Corporate Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Manage ongoing state employment tax requirements with tax providers and any other global compliance filings and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Assist with global year-end processes to ensure all are accurate and timely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Coordinate data for audit responses for periodic internal and external payroll audits and compliance reporting, including 401(k) and Workers Compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Be the initial point of contact for all payroll-related issues from employees. Monitor a payroll email inbox, ticketing service and educate employees with clear, helpful responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Embrace the opportunity to gain experience with new software and improve key processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in finance, accounting, or related field of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Certified Payroll Certification (CPP) designation is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Dayforce experience is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Experience as a Payroll Specialist or similar role managing multi-state payroll. Global experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of payroll processing, payroll taxes, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of federal, state, and local payroll regulations and tax laws&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Proficiency in using payroll software and related tools; experience with automated payroll systems is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Exceptional diligence and accuracy in handling sensitive data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and critical-thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills, both verbal and written, with the ability to effectively communicate complex payroll concepts to employees and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Able to maintain confidentiality and manage sensitive information with professionalism and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;High level of organizational skills and the ability to prioritize tasks and meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Continuous learning mindset and willingness to adapt to evolving payroll practices and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is $ 90,000 to $ 130,000.&amp;nbsp; iCapital offers a compensation package which includes salary, equity for all full-time employees, and an annual performance bonus. Employees also receive a comprehensive benefits package that includes an employer matched retirement plan, generously subsidized healthcare with 100% employer paid dental, vision, telemedicine, and virtual mental health counseling, parental leave, and unlimited paid time off (PTO).&lt;/p&gt;
