&lt;p&gt;iCapital is seeking an Associate to join the Platform Technology Support team, focusing on the Insight, Learning Center, and Architect platform features. This individual has a technical skillset who desires to deliver exceptional client experience in a fast-paced, collaborative, and entrepreneurial environment. This role is highly collaborative, with a strong focus on improving iCapital’s clients&#39; overall satisfaction, and operational processes as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
