&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;iCapital is seeking a Master Data Management Analyst to support the growing needs around data management as well as expanding initiatives to enhance the customer experience of data systems. This individual will be responsible for supporting the day-to-day operations of the data governance program, including ensuring teams are completing data requirements and maintaining data accuracy across critical systems.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Work alongside colleagues across a variety of functional teams to ensure accuracy and completeness of critical data elements within the Fund&#39;s Global Data Master (GDM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Support day-to-day data governance program operations, including tracking and following up with teams to ensure data requirements are completed on time and accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Monitor data quality across systems, identifying gaps, inconsistencies, or missing information and coordinating resolution with relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Assist in the creation and maintenance of business rules to monitor quality of master data.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Identify data cleansing opportunities and work with stakeholders to implement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Liaise with key stakeholders to ensure data accuracy and completeness for relevant data points entered into GDM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate with team members to achieve the team&#39;s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;2+ years of relevant experience in the financial industry or a related role&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Degree in finance, data management, or a related field is preferred&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Previous experience in a master data management role is a plus&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Able to manage workload independently within a predetermined timeline and communicate quickly when an extension may be required&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Solid verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to track multiple workstreams and follow up with stakeholders to drive completion&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Critical attention to detail when reviewing and validating data&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with SQL is a plus&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Knowledge and proficiency with Microsoft Office Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
