&lt;li&gt;Professional demeanor&amp;nbsp;with an entrepreneurial attitude and&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;strong sense of ownership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibits a positive, growth-oriented mindset and takes on new challenges and responsibilities, consistently contributing beyond core responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
