&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The compensation range for this role at the Analyst level is $60,000 to $70,000 annually. This position is paid on an hourly basis and is classified as non-exempt. Employees in this role are eligible for overtime pay in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
