&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is seeking a Vice President Product Manager to join its Independent Advisor Solutions team. This team has launched five 1940 Act registered funds and continues to expand its investment offerings. A core differentiator is iCapital’s partnerships with leading alternative asset managers and top-tier wealth management platforms. This role will collaborate closely with the Portfolio Manager to build and manage an evergreen portfolio that includes direct co-investments, funds, and strategic partnerships. This individual will play a critical role in driving the growth of iCapital’s evergreen registered fund business by overseeing key aspects of fund operations, investor relations, marketing, and distribution strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own all aspects of fund operations and business growth, excluding investment decisions and external marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee marketing initiatives for the fund, including creating and maintaining fundraising presentations, portfolio review materials, quarterly investor call content, and other marketing collateral.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Portfolio Manager on the “business of the fund,” managing distributions, liquidity, and communications with current and prospective investors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic relationships with leading distribution platforms in the wealth management channel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally with the Legal, Accounting, Fund Administration, Operations, Investor Relations, Compliance, and Distribution teams to ensure seamless execution across all aspects of the fund.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
