&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Track and achieve productivity, utilization, and margin metrics in accordance with established company guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate project data, including resourcing, task management, bookings, time recording, budgets, timelines, dependencies, and other required details within project management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Meet established KPIs in alignment with Project Management requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
