&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is looking to hire a Vice President of Regulatory Reporting to join the Regulatory and Compliance team.&amp;nbsp; This position will work closely with the Senior Vice Presidents and Co-Chief Compliance Officers of the Registered Investment Advisers (RIAs) on a variety of compliance matters, most specifically those pertaining to regulatory reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
