&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Record and reconcile accounting transactions in NetSuite in accordance with local accounting standards and Group accounting policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prepare and post journal entries, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Accruals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prepayments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Payroll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Intercompany transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transfer pricing adjustments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Recurring and manual journals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Perform balance sheet reconciliations and supporting schedules.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Manage fixed asset accounting, including capitalization, depreciation and disposals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Maintain and reconcile intercompany balances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support implementation of accounting processes, controls, and new entity setups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Assist with cash accounting and bank reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ensure accuracy and completeness of the general ledger.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Accounts Payable Administration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Process supplier invoices through Coupa and other approved procurement systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Verify coding, approvals, and supporting documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Follow up with business stakeholders on invoice approvals and outstanding exceptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Review AP aging and assist with issue resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support vendor onboarding and master data maintenance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
