&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Execute monthly, quarterly, and annual close activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prepare management accounts for multiple legal entities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support dual-ledger reporting requirements, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
