&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Income statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Balance sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cash flow statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Perform variance analysis against budget and prior periods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Investigate unusual trends and prepare management commentary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support preparation of reporting packages for management review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Audit &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prepare audit schedules and supporting documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
