&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate for this role is a strong cloud architect who excels at both big-picture thinking as well as hands-on technical work.&amp;nbsp; With very strong AWS, Kubernetes and web infrastructure skillsets, they will be working on projects building or improving our core compute, core network and edge infrastructure.They also play a critical role in helping the iCapital platform scale and doing so with an automation-first mentality. The engineer will work with application and platform teams to onboard services, establish connectivity, troubleshoot traffic flows, and maintain consistent networking patterns across environments.&lt;/p&gt;
