&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of AWS infrastructure, including networking, security primitives, and managed services.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This includes expertise in cloud networking architecture patterns, including VPC design, routing, and planning for scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ingress/egress,&amp;nbsp;TGW&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;and private connectivity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as a senior individual contributor with influence across multiple teams as a leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to explain architectural decisions to both technical and nontechnical audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Kong or other API Gateways at a deep level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directly managing Akamai in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of application design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience with EKS standards such as Bottlerocket, Karpenter, Auto-mode&lt;/li&gt;
