&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is looking to hire a Senior Creative Campaign Producer is responsible for developing and executing integrated content campaigns across social media, digital marketing, executive communications, events, and thought leadership initiatives. This role leads the creative process from concept through final delivery, transforming complex business and financial topics into compelling content that drives engagement and advances iCapital’s brand and business objectives. The ideal candidate is an exceptional storyteller, writer, producer, and creative strategist who can develop breakthrough ideas, shape narratives, direct talent, and provide editorial leadership throughout production and post-production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end development and execution of integrated brand, product, marketing, thought leadership, and investment content initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and shape breakthrough campaign ideas, creative platforms, and storytelling frameworks that elevate the iCapital brand and engage key audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and pitch integrated campaign concepts with a clear activation strategy across social media, video, digital, email, events, thought leadership, communications, paid media, ales enablement and internal channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative and editorial direction throughout post-production, including storytelling structure, pacing, graphics, animation, music selection, motion design, and final edit approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure content remains aligned with brand standards, campaign objectives, audience needs, compliance requirements, and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify emerging content trends, storytelling formats, platform opportunities, and creative approaches that elevate iCapital’s content and thought leadership efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure content performance and apply insights to continuously improve creative effectiveness and audience engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in creative production, content development, branded content, video production, advertising, agency, or in-house creative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing content within financial services, asset management, wealth management, fintech, alternative investments, or other complex B2B industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing excellence in short-form content, integrated campaigns, creative storytelling, and multi-channel content activation across brand and investment-focused content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing, storytelling, and creative development skills, with experience creating scripts, interview guides, treatments, presentations, storyboards, creative briefs, and other content assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex financial, investment, market, and industry topics into compelling, audience-focused stories and content experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, stakeholder management, and relationship-building skills, and able to collaborate effectively across creative, marketing, communications, investment, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience balancing creative storytelling with regulatory, compliance, and business requirements within a highly regulated industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $150,000 to $165,000.&amp;nbsp; iCapital offers a compensation package which includes salary, equity for all full-time employees, and an annual performance bonus. Employees also receive a comprehensive benefits package that includes an employer matched retirement plan, generously subsidized healthcare with 100% employer paid dental, vision, telemedicine, and virtual mental health counseling, parental leave, and unlimited paid time off (PTO).&lt;/p&gt;
