&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;iCapital is seeking a Senior UX Writer to enhance the user experience across the iCapital platform by crafting clear, engaging, and user-centered content across all products. This role plays a critical part in shaping how users interact with experiences, including AI-driven capabilities, by defining intuitive inputs and ensuring clear, consistent outputs. The ideal candidate will collaborate closely with cross-functional partners, including product leadership, to elevate content standards and ensure users navigate the platform with clarity and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This individual will operate as both a hands-on contributor and a strategic leader, helping to shape and scale the design system content guidelines and governance frameworks while supporting the complexity of a multi-language, multi-currency product environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as both a hands-on contributor and a strategic leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear, consistent, and user-centered content that guides clients through complex application workflows, subscription and onboarding journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive content design leadership by shaping and evolving iCapital design system writing style guides, reusable patterns, and governance frameworks to ensure consistent, multi-language and multi-currency experiences across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide content recommendation through design critiques, content reviews, and collaborative workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all content aligns with accessibility standards, regulatory guidelines, and plain-language best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple priorities and deliver high-quality content solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with the UX, Product, Legal and Compliance teams and business stakeholders to translate requirements into effective content solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in UX writing, content design, or digital product content strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in English, communications, journalism, UX design, human-computer interaction, or a related discipline, or equivalent experience with financial services, or other regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing application flows, subscriptions, onboarding journeys, and user guidance for digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, user-focused writing for complex systems or enterprise applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and building design systems, content standards, and governance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with collaboration and design tools such as Figma, Confluence, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced product environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with accessibility standards such as WCAG 2.1 AA and inclusive design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI-assisted content tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within legal, regulatory, and compliance review processes, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams to ensure designs meet approval requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio, website, or any other relevant link to your work in your resume is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
